              "raw_id": "ev03",
              "source": "model",
              "source_chunk_id": null
            }
          ],
          "quote": "It had acted quite unbelievably in that well-ordered laboratory; doing nothing at all and showing no occluded gases when heated on charcoal, being wholly negative in the borax bead, and soon proving itself absolutely non-volatile at any producible temperature, including that of the oxy-hydrogen blowpipe."
